@page "/about"
@model NeuronCodec.Web.Pages.AboutModel

<div class="page-narrow page-narrow-about">
    <section class="about-intro">
        <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
        <h1>About NeuronCodec</h1>
        <p>NeuronCodec is an open-source foundation team focusing on neuroscience, biotech, and brain-computer interfaces. NeuronCodec is researching the integration of technology and biology, with a focus on neuroscience.</p>
        <div class="tag-row">
            <span class="tag tag-accent">Neuroscience</span>
            <span class="tag tag-accent-2">Biotech</span>
            <span class="tag tag-neutral">Brain-Computer Interfaces</span>
            <span class="tag tag-outline">AI Lab Automation</span>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
        <span class="eyebrow">Mission</span>
        <h2>Mission</h2>
        <p class="about-body">NeuronCodec's mission is to achieve not only reading the communication data within synapses and a neuron network, but also to apply write actions into memory. The NeuronCodec foundation is also passionate about any integration that a tech stack can bring into a biology stack. Beyond that, NeuronCodec is passionate about automating laboratories with AI agents and boosting research efficiency. The foundation believes the combination of AI, technology, and biology will shape a very promising future for the human race.</p>

        <div class="pillar-grid">
            <div class="card elev-sm">
                <span class="card-kicker">01 — Read</span>
                <h3 class="card-title">Decode the signal</h3>
                <p class="card-body">Reading the communication data carried within synapses and neuron networks.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card elev-sm">
                <span class="card-kicker">02 — Write</span>
                <h3 class="card-title">Write into memory</h3>
                <p class="card-body">Applying write actions into memory — the harder half of a bidirectional interface.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card elev-sm">
                <span class="card-kicker">03 — Automate</span>
                <h3 class="card-title">AI agents in the lab</h3>
                <p class="card-body">Automating laboratories with AI agents to boost research efficiency.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
        <span class="eyebrow">Elsewhere</span>
        <h2>Follow the work</h2>
        <div class="button-row">
            <a href="https://github.com/neuroncodec" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary">GitHub →</a>
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/neuroncodec/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-secondary">LinkedIn →</a>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>
